,"fullName":"Rep. Jayapal, Pramila [D-WA-7]","party":"D","state":"WA"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-09-09","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>Local School Foods Expansion Act of 2025 </strong></p><p>This bill expands and otherwise revises a program to support state procurement of domestically grown unprocessed fruits and vegetables under the National School Lunch Program.</p><p>Specifically, the bill expands the number of participating states from a maximum of 8 to a maximum of 14. </p><p>In addition,&nbsp;the bill&nbsp;establishes additional requirements with respect to priorities, reporting, and evaluations, including with respect to socially disadvantaged populations and the program's economic impact.</p><p>The bill provides funds for the program through FY2030.</p>","updateDate":"2025-09-17T17:22:53Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Local School Foods Expansion Act of 2025","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-09-11T08:05:44Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-09-11T08:05:44Z"}
